@ShotCall.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7102
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..SSw-KEt4olsS4dn_ZW7Q6eh-Boms5jwYhSCutJmawcI
@photographerToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..NCZ1k5rnMS1OMHnMTlcpvAkRU9BLd-5dO8-xH496p0k

### Step 1: Check if the photographer account needs approval
GET {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts?status=PendingApproval
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 2: Admin creates a match
POST {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "Smoke Test Match",
  "category": "Football",
  "matchDate": "2026-09-30T18:00:00",
  "location": "Test Stadium",
  "photographersNeeded": 1
}

### Step 3: Admin approves the photographer
PUT {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/aa95c9c8-f875-4783-9a3e-2bf2206cbfdb/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verify: check the photographer's current status
GET {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts?status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 4: Photographer requests the match (use the matchId from Step 2's response)
POST {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{photographerToken}}

{
  "matchId": "1b943b72-18b9-4f19-91ba-7f210f10dc51"
}
### Get all matches to find the id
GET {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/matches

### Step 5: Admin views pending requests
GET {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 6: Admin accepts the request
PUT {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/requests/3f546133-78fc-4414-9c04-4baeb96d80d7/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 7: Photographer checks their notifications
GET {{ShotCall.API_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{photographerToken}}

